{
  "_comment": [
    "Branch protection for main, ready to apply. NOT ACTIVE — this repository is a private repo on a",
    "plan that returns 403 on both /branches/main/protection and /rulesets ('Upgrade to GitHub Pro or",
    "make this repository public'). Verified 2026-08-26 against both endpoints, so it is the plan and",
    "not the mechanism.",
    "",
    "Apply the moment the plan allows it:",
    "  gh api -X POST repos/HyperionTech2026/creditpaper/rulesets --input .github/ruleset-main.json",
    "",
    "Then confirm with:",
    "  gh api repos/HyperionTech2026/creditpaper/rulesets --jq '.[] | \"\\(.name) · \\(.enforcement)\"'",
    "",
    "The six required checks are the exact job names emitted by .github/workflows/ci.yml. If a job is",
    "renamed there, rename it here too — a required check that no longer exists blocks every merge,",
    "which is the failure mode this file is most likely to cause."
  ],
  "name": "main",
  "target": "branch",
  "enforcement": "active",
  "conditions": {
    "ref_name": {
      "include": ["~DEFAULT_BRANCH"],
      "exclude": []
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    { "type": "deletion" },
    { "type": "non_fast_forward" },
    {
      "type": "pull_request",
      "parameters": {
        "required_approving_review_count": 1,
        "dismiss_stale_reviews_on_push": true,
        "require_code_owner_review": true,
        "require_last_push_approval": false,
        "required_review_thread_resolution": true,
        "allowed_merge_methods": ["squash", "merge"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "required_status_checks",
      "parameters": {
        "strict_required_status_checks_policy": true,
        "required_status_checks": [
          { "context": "lint, format, types" },
          { "context": "tests (py3.11)" },
          { "context": "tests (py3.13)" },
          { "context": "generated files are current" },
          { "context": "web app" },
          { "context": "secret scan" }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "bypass_actors": [
    {
      "actor_id": 5,
      "actor_type": "RepositoryRole",
      "bypass_mode": "always"
    }
  ]
}
